{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"AMO","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"阿摩司书","commonName":"阿摩司书","title":"阿摩司书","order":30,"numberOfChapters":9,"sha256":"aea65afe0e5862ee36486d1d8f71c20a1bc4c3aa5415828aa0c58b4c80057d03","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/AMO/1.json","lastChapterNumber":9,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/AMO/9.json","totalNumberOfVerses":146},"chapter":{"number":4,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"住在撒玛利亚山上的巴珊肥母牛啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要听此言！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们压榨贫寒人，欺凌穷苦人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又叫丈夫拿酒来畅饮。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，主耶和华凭祂的圣洁起誓：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“时候快到了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有人要用鱼钩钩走你们，一个也不留。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们都要从城墙缺口走出来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被丢到哈门。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"“以色列人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们去伯特利犯罪吧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"去吉甲增添罪恶吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要每天早晨献上祭物，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"每三天奉上你们的十分之一。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们献上带酵的饼作感恩祭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"并且到处夸耀你们自愿献的祭。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列人啊，这就是你们爱做的事。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是主耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"“我在各城降下饥荒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你们遍地缺粮。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"尽管如此，你们仍不归向我。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"“我在收割前三个月停止降雨。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我在一座城降雨，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在另一座城不降雨；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我使一块田有雨水的滋润，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"另一块田因无雨而干裂。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"两三座城的人都踉踉跄跄地涌到一座城找水喝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"水却不够喝。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"尽管如此，你们仍不归向我。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"“我用热风和霉灾击打你们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"叫蝗虫吞噬你们田园中的菜蔬、葡萄树、无花果树和橄榄树。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"尽管如此，你们仍不归向我。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"“我在你们中间降下瘟疫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如从前降在埃及一样。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我杀戮你们的青年，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"掳掠你们的战马，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你们军营中的死尸臭味扑鼻。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"尽管如此，你们仍不归向我。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"“我在你们中间施行毁灭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如从前毁灭所多玛和蛾摩拉一样，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你们像从火里抽出的一根柴。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"尽管如此，你们仍不归向我。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"“以色列人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要这样惩罚你们。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"准备迎见你们的上帝吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为我要这样惩罚你们。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"看啊，那位造山又造风、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向人显明其心意、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"将黎明变为黑暗、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"踏在地之高处的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂的名字是万军之上帝耶和华。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/AMO/4.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/AMO/5.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/AMO/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}